characters break the tension with cynical, darkly funny moments. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.poster.avif?t=1763132740\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.webm?t=1763132740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/fbff5e47ead8bceb38067b48ad01207e.mp4?t=1763132740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet the Denizens of Block 17</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You will encounter not only monstrous lifeforms, but also an artificial intelligence created to maintain order \u2013 its motives unclear \u2013 and a sentient biological entity desperately trying to reach the surface, along with rare survivors fighting to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will determine who you become and whose side you're truly on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.poster.avif?t=1763132740\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.webm?t=1763132740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/aac52bb8ed8aaf439c4af957a0391de5.mp4?t=1763132740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade and Adapt</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find secrets hidden throughout the prison, navigate gloomy corridors, explore rooms, and upgrade your weapons and bot's abilities. The game features many unique enemies with distinct abilities that will create numerous challenging situations. Environmental storytelling elements are designed to shed light on what happened in Block 17.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71ce0433320f1e2d4069dcf.poster.avif?t=1763132740\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71ce0433320f1e2d4069dcf.webm?t=1763132740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/extras/ea10f234a71ce0433320f1e2d4069dcf.mp4?t=1763132740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cinematic Pixel-Art Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've put great effort into the visuals \u2013 even with pixel art, we strive for cinematic lighting and an expressive atmosphere so that every moment feels alive and threatening. We are constantly developing our own solutions to make the light and effects as spectacular as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, the development is in full swing. If you are interested in our project, please add the game to your wishlist and follow us!</strong></p>","developers":["Pixel Fusion Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083210/8e68b6651bceb73ddb641b8a7b8f9084340dc7f1/header.jpg?t=1763132740","is_free":false,"linux_